stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unauthenticated
    Unauthenticated --> AuthenticatedSession : Complete OTP & Issue Token Pair
    AuthenticatedSession --> TokenRefreshed : Present Valid Refresh Token (Issue New Pair)
    TokenRefreshed --> AuthenticatedSession
    AuthenticatedSession --> SessionRevoked : Device Unlinked or User Logout
    AuthenticatedSession --> TokenReuseBreach : Re-use Consumed Refresh Token
    TokenReuseBreach --> SessionRevoked : Revoke All Family Device Sessions
    SessionRevoked --> [*]
